					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					209
				</span></i>
			(lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>conspicuous, eminent,</i> Hippias Soph.<i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Dio</u>
				54
			</span></i>; 
